/E (I, Divyansh Sikarwar, hereby declare that the internship report titled "CYBER SECURITY INTERNSHIP: Practical Study of Cybersecurity Fundamentals, Vulnerability Assessment and Security Awareness" has been prepared by me as part of my internship experience with CodeAlpha. The report presents the cybersecurity concepts, practical activities, security-analysis methods and learning outcomes covered during the internship period. All material drawn from external references has been acknowledged appropriately. I further declare that this report has been prepared for academic purposes and that I am responsible for the originality and accuracy of the work presented herein. )
