/E (Modern applications, networks and users are exposed to a wide range of cyber threats. Weak configurations, insecure authentication, outdated software, excessive privileges, unsafe links, social-engineering attacks and poor security awareness can create opportunities for unauthorized access or data loss. A major challenge for an aspiring cybersecurity professional is therefore to identify potential weaknesses systematically, understand the associated risks and recommend practical controls. The internship )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
